authoritative simulation/content; native art/presentation/audio; frontend/input; Hub adapter and conformance.\\\\n\\\\n## Delivery gates\\\\n- Full fixed-step rescue operation, boss/extraction and 180-second Evasion.\\\\n- Real local and Hub shared-ship co-op, all input families, saves/settings/tools/attract.\\\\n- Single standalone HTML in workspace root; exit-interview.json with matching in-game credits.\\\\n- Quiet verification command, action-driven complete run, Hub harness, audio and visual review.\\\\n\"'`);\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({title,stem}));\nJS'","aggregated_output":"{\"title\":\"Freedom Warp Rescue\",\"stem\":\"Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
