{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The title draw selected **Freedom Warp Rescue**. The source manual confirms the core mechanics: contact rescues, fragile purple crystals, mine-laying warships, and a second drive controlled by a co-pilot. The engine and Hub revisions match those cited in the plan. Art and audio, controls and menus, and networking are now being built in parallel.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"curl -fsSL 'https://odyssey2.info/i/screens/free-scr.gif' -o 'Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/reference-1.gif' && curl -fsSL 'https://odyssey2.info/i/screens/free-scr2.gif' -o 'Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/reference-2.gif' && magick 'Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/reference-1.gif' 'Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/reference-1.png' && magick 'Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/reference-2.gif' 'Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/reference-2.png' && node - <<'JS'\nconst fs=require('fs');let h=fs.readFileSync('Freedom-Warp-Rescue-Freedom-Fighters-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-023037/docs/video-reference.html','utf8');let m=h.match(/var ytInitialPlayerResponse\\\\s*=\\\\s*(\\\\{.+?\\\\});/s);if(m){try{let d=JSON.parse(m[1]);console.log(JSON.stringify({playability:d.playabilityStatus,title:d.videoDetails?.title,duration:d.videoDetails?.lengthSeconds,streaming:\"'!!d.streamingData}));}catch(e){console.log(e.message)}}\nJS'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
